      "en": "Do you indeed speak righteousness, silent ones? Do you judge blamelessly, you sons of men?",
      "ko": "인자들아 너희가 당연히 공의를 말하겠거늘 어찌 잠잠하느뇨 너희가 정직히 판단하느뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "70138be32b4fe319c9535763c2eac38972c5f71b9f9081033313785f44223b01",
      "translation_text_hash": "118c61645b1fbcae2c728b97657b6fa72fcd6fb666dc4f29b2ed5a6abd8f8d18",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
