      "en": "The wicked go astray from the womb. They are wayward as soon as they are born, speaking lies.",
      "ko": "악인은 모태에서부터 멀어졌음이여 나면서부터 곁길로 나아가 거짓을 말하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "d3c4a001954b2147a9470ea3de2231c78191eb4374c9ac7dd6299322c8526edc",
      "translation_text_hash": "4178d6d60dbb3d65c960125b57bd2384716b04aa98a53645e16006e84a835184",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
