      "en": "Let them vanish like water that flows away. When they draw the bow, let their arrows be made blunt.",
      "ko": "저희로 급히 흐르는 물 같이 사라지게 하시며 겨누는 살이 꺾임 같게 하시며",
      "source_text_hash": "58b51dd0b30cea5d60557bbaf3ac0c560cefcd30a6b70d5a69ebdc4188f38f59",
      "translation_text_hash": "f74a65439c098574a95185c3cd603be1fbf9b4870a9f28adfbfca038a7b35208",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
