      "en": "The righteous shall rejoice when he sees the vengeance. He shall wash his feet in the blood of the wicked,",
      "ko": "의인은 악인의 보복 당함을 보고 기뻐함이여 그 발을 악인의 피에 씻으리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "4df35fc2ee02bc80445e135655a438551b292c8d0c1093e57337b2e512e73b52",
      "translation_text_hash": "93f4865fea3ed60c1dd960b4041f41c8a9cd9a13b31db2273ca9fff808d74d84",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
